{"entries":[{"id":"event-1","kind":"opening","title":"戰鬥前","steps":{"$keys":["scene"],"$rows":[[{"background":1,"camera":[8,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":14,"base":"configured"},{"line":0}],[{"background":1,"camera":[8,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":15,"base":"configured"},{"line":1}],[{"background":1,"camera":[8,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":16,"base":"configured"},{"line":2}],[{"background":1,"camera":[8,0],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":17,"base":"configured","pan":{"from":{"camera":[8,62]},"speed":[2,2]}},{"visual_only":true}],[{"background":1,"camera":[10,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":20,"base":"configured"},{"line":3}],[{"background":1,"camera":[10,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":21,"base":"configured"},{"line":4}],[{"background":1,"camera":[10,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":22,"base":"configured"},{"line":5}],[{"background":1,"camera":[10,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":23,"base":"configured"},{"line":6}],[{"background":1,"camera":[10,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":24,"base":"configured"},{"line":7}],[{"background":1,"camera":[10,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":25,"base":"configured"},{"line":8}],[{"background":1,"camera":[10,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":26,"base":"configured"},{"line":9}],[{"background":1,"camera":[10,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":27,"base":"configured"},{"line":10}],[{"background":1,"camera":[10,62],"layers":[],"units":{"$":0},"step":28,"base":"configured"},{"line":11}]],"$extra":true},"conditions":[{"label":"戰鬥前的開場劇情"}],"lines":{"$keys":["speaker","speaker_key","side","text","portrait"],"$rows":[["韓千秀","face:7",1,"嘩，這裡的景象又與之前的大大不同！",{"$m":457}],["鮮于超","face:5",1,"不愧是地界幽都，不論風土景色都與地上大異其趣，俺拜血鎖鍊之賜活了這麼多年，還是第一次見到如此不可思議的光景。",{"$m":527}],["真胤","face:6",1,"貧僧也有同感。修羅鬼界果然是真有其事，然而如今親眼目睹，卻又覺得如真似幻，彷彿是自己是在作一場大夢一般。",{"$m":543}],["紫楓","face:3",1,"冥幽玄幻，地界四海。這原非生人所應見的景象，咱們靠著混元寶塔強闖，此舉雖是大違天道諸理，但也是出於不得已。",{"$m":530}],["上官遠","face:4",1,"雖是如此，咱們也是為了阻止劍邪，為天下蒼生性命才赴地界，咱們師出有名，就算諸神眾仙說咱們不是，也管不了那許多了。不過我說紫楓大姐，這裡全是峭壁斷崖，雖然看來壯觀雄偉，但咱們一路來此，總不是來賞景稱奇的吧？",{"$m":498}],["紫楓","face:3",1,"自然不是。各位可有看到遠方那石陣與發光的晶盤？",{"$m":530}],["殷劍平","face:1",1,"見到了。那石陣的排列似與封有蚩尤右角的荒石塚類似，但不知那水晶明鏡是？",{"$m":478}],["紫楓","face:3",1,"那是前往地界核心『玄海』的天鏡法陣，在那裡施用移遁之法，便可把站在天鏡上的大夥都送到幻海的三荒冥原，根據古籍的記載，赤煉淵就位在三荒冥原的某處。",{"$m":530}],["封寒月","face:2",1,"啊！我也聽過三荒之原，聽說那裡冰火共濟，世上至熱與至寒的異所奇景。莫非神劍就藏在那裡？",{"$m":489}],["紫楓","face:3",1,"正是。不過這天鏡法陣亦能聚斂靈氣，向來是群妖所好之處，咱們要使用法陣，得先打發了盤據於此的眾多妖魔才行。",{"$m":530}],["上官遠","face:4",1,"總而言之，又得活動活動筋骨了。別的倒還不易，打架最是簡單，咱們這就上吧！",{"$m":498}],["殷劍平","face:1",1,"嗯！",{"$m":478}]]}},{"id":"event-2","kind":"victory","title":"戰鬥勝利","steps":[{"line":0,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[8,8],"layers":[],"units":{"$keys":["id","visible"],"$rows":[[0,true,{"x":12,"y":12,"group":1,"direction":2}],[1,true,{"x":11,"y":12,"group":1,"direction":2}],[2,true,{"x":12,"y":11,"group":1,"direction":0}],[3,true,{"group":1,"x":11,"y":10,"direction":0}],[4,true,{"group":1,"x":12,"y":10,"direction":0}],[5,true,{"group":1,"x":13,"y":10,"direction":0}],[6,true,{"group":1,"x":10,"y":11,"direction":3}],[7,true,{"group":1,"x":13,"y":12,"direction":2}],[8,true,{"group":1,"x":14,"y":11,"direction":1}],[9,false,{}],[10,false,{}],[11,false,{}],[12,false,{}],[13,false,{}],[14,false,{}],[15,false,{}],[16,false,{}],[17,false,{}],[18,false,{}],[19,false,{}],[20,false,{}],[21,false,{}],[22,false,{}],[23,false,{}],[24,false,{}],[25,false,{}],[26,false,{}],[27,false,{}],[28,false,{}],[29,false,{}],[30,false,{}],[31,false,{}],[32,false,{}],[33,false,{}],[34,false,{}],[35,false,{}],[36,false,{}],[37,false,{}],[38,false,{}],[39,false,{}],[40,false,{}],[41,false,{}],[42,false,{}],[43,false,{}],[44,false,{}],[45,false,{}],[46,false,{}],[47,false,{}],[48,false,{}],[49,false,{}],[50,false,{}],[51,false,{}],[52,false,{}],[53,false,{}],[54,false,{}]],"$extra":true},"step":25,"base":"overview"}}],"next_scene":"battle:26","conditions":[{"label":"戰鬥勝利：敵方全滅"}],"lines":[{"speaker":"紫楓","speaker_key":"face:3","side":1,"text":"大夥都站定了麼？我這就開始施「移遁之法」。仙道御法神移天相八方流轉魂軀同昇光舞騰挪....","portrait":{"$m":530}}]}],"$mediaVersion":"4c29e4788a96","$pool":[[{"id":0,"direction":2},{"id":1,"direction":2},{"id":2,"direction":2},{"id":3,"direction":2},{"id":4,"direction":2},{"id":5,"direction":2},{"id":6,"direction":2},{"id":7,"direction":2},{"id":8,"visible":true,"group":1,"direction":2}]]}